== hunger_ending
The hunger is not endless. There comes a point when you defeat it. [br]The cold closes in and you start to tremble, something you haven't done since you turned. Perhaps this is a kind of victory, holding on to your humanity to the end.[br]You die human.  [end]
->continue->
-> EndDemo

== survival_ending

You lasted {nights_lasted} nights... survival is all that matters and you are a survivor.  [end]
